# Trivy exceptions for gha-demo-api-ecs
# Repo: dropstat-org/gha-demo-api-ecs
# Branch: release/gha-demo-api-ecs
#
# Format: CVE-ID or GHSA-ID, one per line. Add reason as comment.
# The pipeline picks this up automatically on every run.
#
# Example:
# CVE-2024-12345  # false positive: not exploitable in our Flask context
# GHSA-xxxx-yyyy  # vendor patch pending, review by 2025-12-31
